-/* Our HT and VHT capability as constants (mainline: the firmware's service-ready ht_cap_info and vht_cap_info through mac.c ath10k_get_ht_cap and ath10k_create_vht_cap); A-MPDU 64K and 8 us density are mac.c's fixed values, two streams. */
